# P26-16 — preapproved headless stdio startup

Date: 2026-11-02

Command (file redirection, no pipes):
`node packages/dsh-tool-mode/bin/dsh-tool-mode-mcp-stdio.mjs` with
`DSH_TOOL_MODE_MCP_TOKEN=preapproved-test-token`, empty stdin, invalid endpoint URL,
stdout/stderr redirected to files.

Observed:
- exit code: 0
- stdout bytes: 0
- stderr: `stdin closed; bridge-owned requests aborted`

A preapproved token lets the headless bridge start and shut down cleanly on EOF; output
remains protocol-free. The missing-token case (earlier log) exits 2 with guidance. Neither
case hangs, and no token is printed.
